{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-49"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-talk-403815292-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","missionId":"event-rogue-49","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"승진하고 첫 번째 날을 맞이했다! 당신은 우뚝 솟은 지사 건물을 올려다보며 뛰어난 「P-16」 정직원이 되어 신입 계약직들을 잘 챙기리라 다짐했다. 당신의 시선은 더 높은 피라미드의 꼭대기를 향해있었다…","talkId":403815292,"textHash":"9914438489922871991","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:49/talk-403815292","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e6e44140b77a49a4","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-talk-403815293-line"],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其二）","bwikiRevision":58919,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10396","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-talk-403815293-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","missionId":"event-rogue-49","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"흠… 당신은 스타피스 가이드에 적힌 관리자 소개를 읽고 있다. 외모와 언변 뭐 하나 빠지지 않는 「P-25」 지사장이 마음에 들지 않았다. 어쩌면… 그 사람보다 당신이 더 뛰어날지도?","talkId":403815293,"textHash":"724950045029762281","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:49/talk-403815293","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e6e44140b77a49a4","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-talk-403815294-line"],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其二）","bwikiRevision":58919,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10396","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-talk-403815294-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","missionId":"event-rogue-49","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"이제… 스스로의 재능을 뽐낼 차례가 왔다","talkId":403815294,"textHash":"1608842388446930467","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:49/talk-403815294","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e6e44140b77a49a4","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其二）","bwikiRevision":58919,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10396","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-text-2414915562501157331-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","missionId":"event-rogue-49","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"임시 고용인의 심신 건강을 신경쓴다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2414915562501157331","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:49/text-2414915562501157331","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c094cff5b4580e97","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其二）","bwikiRevision":58919,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10396","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-text-4603460931247667767-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","missionId":"event-rogue-49","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"다음주를 *종족 간 친목 파티*로 가득 채운다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"4603460931247667767","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:49/text-4603460931247667767","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aea404458be266fb","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其二）","bwikiRevision":58919,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10396","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-49-text-16043634856343520743-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-49","missionId":"event-rogue-49","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"「우주금융회의」를 개최한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"16043634856343520743","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:49/text-16043634856343520743","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"18391849bb2e9b49","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage"